# The pass that takes the Workshop gallery's pictures, and nothing else.
#
# The scenes are played on the sanctuary save "Nelims-tribe" carried by Sanctuary Backlot (the named
# places and the steps "Nelim's Sanctuary: ..."), with PickleTools' ScreenshotStudio for the studio steps
# and two companions the shots lean on. The fixture must come from the Backlot only: two fixtures of that
# name fail Pickle. Used with -DepMap wsl-deps.sanctuary.map (it replaces wsl-deps.studio.map, owner rule
# of 2026-10-09: gallery scenarios play in the Sanctuary, not in the zen meadow studio).
#
# Feature 14 is valid only here. The other passes skip it through its @requires tags.
#
# Anomaly stays ON: the shots are of the mod doing its job, which needs the DLC.
nelim.sanctuarybacklot             path:SanctuaryBacklot/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio path:PickleTools/ScreenshotStudio/Mod
nelim.pickletools.clearscreen      path:PickleTools/ClearScreen/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode   path:PickleTools/ScreenshotMode/Mod
nelim.pickletools.colonistrace     path:PickleTools/ColonistRace/Mod
